paces with our Playfoam Pads, specifically designed to complement Playfall Tiles.<\/p><p>These foam pads fit perfectly under our Playfall Tiles, enhancing absorption and reducing the risk of injuries from high-impact falls.<\/p>","button_label":"Upgrade Extra Protection here","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/foam-playpads","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"39f5b6ef-ef0d-4259-94da-f16375461e13":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/3_9dba6089-e891-44e8-af96-4bf72a393998.jpg","image_width":600,"subtitle":"Smooth Transitions","title":"Add Playfoam Edging","text":"<p>Designed for smooth transitions, these edging ramps allow for easy access to elevated play surfaces, ensuring children of all abilities can join in the fun.<\/p><p>Perfectly compatible with our Playfall Tiles, they provide a slanted, gradual approach that minimizes the risk of trips and falls. These edge ramps are available for all fall heights.<\/p>","button_label":"Enhance Your Playground Now","button_link":"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/playfall-edging","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"8b773cae-7b95-43e5-bab3-2af5a3628901":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"Elevate Your Golfing Performance","text":"<p>Enhance your short game with a personal putting green from Canada Mats! Our premium golf products offer natural grass-like reactions for ideal putting and chipping. Ideal for golf courses and applications of all sizes,  Upgrade your golf experience with our top-notch solutions.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/golf-ball-on-tee.jpg","focal_point":"bottom","layout":"right","height":550,"framed":true,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"4a7370cb-d067-4e44-83ab-c38729ef6f04":{"t